// SD character sheet — item-shop data (SHOP_MAGIC, SHOP_MAGIC_SUBS,
// SD_SPELL_FULL). Split out of sd_character_sheet.html so this ~60KB of
// static data is cached by the browser instead of re-parsed inline on every
// sheet open. Loaded at the same point in the page, so declaration order is
// unchanged. scripts/extract-game-data.mjs reads SHOP_MAGIC from THIS file.
